# Localized dashboard screenshots are only referenced by the GitHub-hosted
# localized READMEs. The Marketplace renders README.md (English), which uses
# only dashboard-en-1.png, so the non-English shots are dead weight in the VSIX.
docs/assets/screenshots/dashboard-zh-tw-*.png
docs/assets/screenshots/dashboard-zh-cn-*.png
docs/assets/screenshots/dashboard-ja-*.png
docs/assets/screenshots/dashboard-ko-*.png
